@DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### 0. Health Check
GET {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### 0.1 OpenAPI JSON Specification
GET {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### 0.2 Scalar UI
GET {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/scalar/v1

### 0.3 System Info
GET {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/system/info
Accept: application/json

---
### 1. Categories Endpoints

### 1.1 Get All Categories
GET {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 Get Category by ID (with Top Products preview and valuation)
GET {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/categories/1
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 Get Products in Category (Paginated)
GET {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/categories/1/products?pageNumber=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### 1.4 Create New Category
POST {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Smart Home & IoT",
  "description": "Connected smart lighting, security cameras, and automation sensors."
}

### 1.5 Update Category
PUT {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/categories/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Electronics & Audio Gear",
  "description": "Updated description for premium consumer electronics and studio sound equipment."
}

### 1.6 Delete Category (Fails if products exist - 409 Conflict)
DELETE {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/categories/1

---
### 2. Products Endpoints

### 2.1 Get Products (Default Pagination)
GET {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Accept: application/json

### 2.2 Search Products by Keyword
GET {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/products?search=wireless
Accept: application/json

### 2.3 Filter Products by Category, Price Range, and InStockOnly
GET {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/products?categoryId=1&minPrice=100&maxPrice=500&inStockOnly=true
Accept: application/json

### 2.4 Sort Products by Price Descending
GET {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/products?sortBy=price&sortDescending=true&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

### 2.5 Get Product by ID
GET {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### 2.6 Get Product by SKU
GET {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/sku/ELEC-HDPH-001
Accept: application/json

### 2.7 Create Product (Success)
POST {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Zenith Ultra 27-inch 4K Monitor",
  "sku": "ELEC-MON-004",
  "description": "IPS Black panel with 98% DCI-P3 color gamut, USB-C 90W charging, and height adjustable stand.",
  "price": 549.99,
  "stockQuantity": 20,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "isActive": true
}

### 2.8 Create Product Validation Error (Demonstrates RFC 7807 ValidationProblem)
POST {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "sku": "invalid sku with spaces!",
  "description": "Short",
  "price": -10.00,
  "stockQuantity": -5,
  "categoryId": 9999,
  "isActive": true
}

### 2.9 Update Product
PUT {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "SonicPro Wireless ANC Headphones v2",
  "sku": "ELEC-HDPH-001",
  "description": "Updated high-fidelity wireless over-ear headphones with Bluetooth 5.4 and lossless spatial audio.",
  "price": 319.99,
  "stockQuantity": 50,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "isActive": true
}

### 2.10 Adjust Product Inventory Stock (+10 units)
PATCH {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/stock
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "adjustment": 10,
  "reason": "Restocked from warehouse shipment"
}

### 2.11 Toggle Product Active Status (Deactivate)
PATCH {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### 2.12 Delete Product
DELETE {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/10

---
### 3. Reviews Endpoints

### 3.1 Get Product Reviews (with rating calculation)
GET {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/reviews
Accept: application/json

### 3.2 Add Review to Product
POST {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/products/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "authorName": "Chris Evans",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Superb soundstage and build quality. The battery life easily surpasses the advertised 40 hours."
}

### 3.3 Delete Review
DELETE {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/reviews/1

---
### 4. Analytics & Reports Endpoints

### 4.1 Get Catalog Summary (Financial & Inventory Valuation)
GET {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/summary
Accept: application/json

### 4.2 Get Low Stock Products (Threshold = 5)
GET {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/analytics/low-stock?threshold=5
Accept: application/json

---
### 5. System Reset

### 5.1 Reset & Reseed Database
POST {{DotnetMinimalApi_HostAddress}}/api/system/reset-and-seed
